==Battleground==
*2 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Doctor K.O.]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**4 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Shachiko]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't too difficult, use [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] to stall Relic Bun while your special legends like [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] and [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]] chip down at it. [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] can be used to quickly kill Shachiko. Relic Bun Bun should fall at around the point that Elizabeth makes her appearance, at which point you can use your generic Wave counters like [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] and/or [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to deal with her.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Dr.Nova]]: If you happen to have her, Nova can be a big help on this stage, slowing everything down despite lacking Wave Immunity.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]]: As with basically any stage featuring relic, alien and red enemies Luna will nearly always be a good pick, this stage is no exception. She freezes Relic Bun-Bun and Elizabeth the LVIth while also blocking her Waves, and while Doctor K.O. resists her Freeze, he still recives her full DPS.
*[[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave Immune Backliners]]: Good choices include [[Talents|Ultra Talented]] [[Splendid Ganesha (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Ganesha]] or [[Anubis the Protector (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Anubis]]. Just be sure to nuke Shachiko with [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]].

